node_modules/

# Third-party HRTF data, fetched by hand — see HRIR/README.md.
# Apache 2.0 and freely redistributable, but ~110 MB per subject and not ours
# to carry: the tools take a path to it rather than expecting it in the tree.
HRIR/**
!HRIR/README.md
# The two HRIRs the virtual-loudspeaker render convolves against are small and
# the app fetches them at runtime, so unlike the rest of the set they ship.
!HRIR/virtual-speaker-left.wav
!HRIR/virtual-speaker-right.wav
